# The token empower Jace creates: "a blue Jace planeswalker token with 0 loyalty, '[−1]: Surveil
# 1,' and '[−3]: Draw a card.'" [CR#701.71a]
token jaceToken {
  spelling = "Jace planeswalker token",
  body = {
    characteristics = {
      colors = [blue],
      types = [planeswalker],
      subtypes = [jace],
      text = [
        activated(loyaltySymbol(down(1)), surveil(1)),
        activated(loyaltySymbol(down(3)), draw(1))],
      loyalty = 0}}
}
